**step 1 setenv reg_gen_from_excel.py path  **

    1)g ~/.cshrc

    2)add content str to ~/.cshrc as followes:

        alias reg_gen_from_excel '/project/dig_veri_ip/cs-digital-ip/common_script/script_for_verify/scripts/ral_gen/reg_gen_from_excel/reg_gen_from_excel.py'

** step 2  write regsheet_format.yml or regsheet_format_78x.yml**

    Normal mode as follow:
    1) if there are no description related to permission and reset fields in the register excel, copy the regsheet_format.yml to the local directory and modify it
    2) permission access and reset fields descriotion in the register excel, copy the regsheet_format_78x.yml to the local directory and modify it

    Templete test mode as followe:

     modify template_test_mode to True
     add template_test_input_file_path 
     add template_test_output_file_name

     example------ add in regsheet_format ---
        template_test:
            template_test_mode:
                True 
            template_test_input_file_path:
                ./template/initialize_reg_info.sv
            template_test_output_file_name:
                initialize_test_reg_info.sv

** step 3 use gen_reg_chk_file_from_excel gen the reg file to outdir path **

    Normal and Test mode cmd all as follow:

    reg_gen_from_excel -i ./doc/RCU_1.xlsx -y regsheet_format_78x.yml -o test/

or

    reg_gen_from_excel -i doc/Airbag_register_map.xlsx -y regsheet_format.yml -o test1/

** step 4 copy the generate file to your $WORK_DIR path **

